#: ../../chapter10.rst:3
msgid "Branding"
msgstr "Branding"

#: ../../chapter10.rst:5
msgid ""
"You can brand the web portal, Windows and Mac clients, iOS and Android "
"Applications."
msgstr "U kunt het webportaal, de Windows- en Mac-clients, iOS- en Android-applicaties brandmerken."

#: ../../chapter10.rst:8
msgid "Self-Service Branding"
msgstr "Zelfbediening Branding"

#: ../../chapter10.rst:10
msgid ""
"The self-service branding starts with the \"Cluster Manager\". In order "
"to start the branding, you will login to the web portal as the Cluster "
"Administrator."
msgstr "Het zelfbedieningsbranding begint met de \"Cluster Manager\". Om met de branding te beginnen, logt u in op het webportaal als de Clusterbeheerder."

#: ../../chapter10.rst:13
msgid ""
"After you login to the web portal, click to the \"Cluster Branding\" "
"Pages."
msgstr "Nadat u bent ingelogd op het webportaal, klikt u op de \"Cluster Branding\" pagina's."

#: ../../chapter10.rst:17
msgid ""
"Please reference the \"Branding\" section in the `Admin Guide`__ for the "
"self-hosted |prodname| server."
msgstr "Raadpleeg de sectie \"Branding\" in de `Admin Guide`__ voor de zelfgehoste |prodname| server."

